# Phase 18 offline benchmark — 2026-10-16 18:13 UTC

- Executed `cargo bench -p rocketmq-classic --bench offline --locked` on code
  revision `15c6ca4f`, macOS AArch64, Apple M5 Max, 18 logical CPUs, Rust
  `1.85.0 (4d91de4e4 2025-02-17)`, optimized release profile.
- Measured all five fixed-input operations with configured iteration counts and
  allocation sampling. The outputs are appended to
  `docs/compatibility/PHASE_18_OFFLINE_BENCHMARK_BASELINE.md`: frame encode /
  decode 1,932.5 ns; Zstd message decode 1,162.8 ns; Producer request
  construction 1,176.4 ns; route lookup 15.1 ns; loopback pending completion
